<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch state plans no bond issues in Q4 1996.</title>
<headline>Dutch state plans no bond issues in Q4 1996.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch government does not plan any bond issues in the final quarter of 1996, the Finance Ministry's debt agency said on Monday.</p>
<p>In the third quarter a single tap issue was announced.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
